<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav June unemployment 820,733 vs 824,138.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav June unemployment 820,733 vs 824,138.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV UNEMPLOYMENT  June 96	 May 96	June 95</p>
<p> number seeking work    820,733	824,138	765,391</p>
<p> vacancies		   23,852	 27,337	 25,709</p>
<p> total employed	 2.075 million    2.085 million    2.114 million</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data do not include private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
